{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"MediaWiki REST revision HTML, sanitized","nodeCount":558,"content":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwAQ"},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwAg"},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwAw"},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Party"]}]},"\n",{"type":"hr","props":{},"children":[]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Party"]}," is a system which allows players to easily start matches with each other. In ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Matchmaking","title":"Matchmaking"},"children":["Matchmaking"]},", it will make players in the ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Party"]}," all be in the same match, while for ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Elevators","title":"Elevators"},"children":["Elevators"]},", it will make all the players get teleported into the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Elevators","title":"Elevators"},"children":["Elevator"]},". Its menu also contains a section for invites."]},"\n"]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwDA"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Party"},"children":["Party"]},"\n",{"type":"figure","props":{"id":"mwDQ"},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/File:Matchmaking2.png"},"children":["Wiki media omitted"]},{"type":"figcaption","props":{},"children":[]}]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["When entering the ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Party"]}," menu while not being in a ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Party"]},", the player will be shown a list of public ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Parties"]}," and a button which allows them to create a ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Party"]},". Up to six people can be in one ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Party"]},", though if the ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Party"]}," player count is higher than the selected squad size in ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Matchmaking","title":"Matchmaking"},"children":["Matchmaking"]},", the game will not allow the player to start a match."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["Once in a party, there are two screens. The first is ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Party"]}," member list, showing every member of it, including their username, level and profile icon. On the right, there is a list of users to invite. The first users shown are the player's friends. Their level is not displayed, only information about them is them being online. They will be invited to the player's party through Roblox notifications. The second group of users is players in the server. Their level will also be displayed. For both groups, their username and profile icon is also displayed."]},"\n\n",{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwHA"},"children":[{"type":"h3","props":{"id":"Settings"},"children":["Settings"]},"\n",{"type":"figure","props":{"id":"mwHQ"},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/File:Matchmaking9.png"},"children":["Wiki media omitted"]},{"type":"figcaption","props":{},"children":[]}]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["There are a few settings for ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Parties"]}," which can be changed by the ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Party"]}," leader."]},"\n",{"type":"ol","props":{},"children":[{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"i","props":{},"children":["Party Lock"]}," is a setting which makes the ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Party"]}," be invite only. It is enabled by default, but it used to be disabled."]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"i","props":{},"children":["Members Can Invite"]}," is a setting which makes it so that other ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Party"]}," members can invite players. It is disabled by default."]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"i","props":{},"children":["Maximum Level"]}," is the maximum level a player can have for them to join a ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Party"]},". It is set to 1,000 by default, and it has no limit to what it can be set to."]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"i","props":{},"children":["Minimum Level"]}," is the minimum level a player can have for them to join a ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Party"]},". It is set to 0 by default, and it has no limit to what it can be set to."]}]},"\n\n"]}]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwMg"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Invites"},"children":["Invites"]},"\n",{"type":"figure","props":{"id":"mwMw"},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/File:Matchmaking3.png"},"children":["Wiki media omitted"]},{"type":"figcaption","props":{},"children":[]}]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["Players can be invited to your party. When invited, they will receive a message about them being invited, regardless of where they are on Roblox. If invited in the lobby and the invite is not accepted instantly, the invite will be included in the invites section of the ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Party"]}," menu. In this case, the invite can be accepted or denied. If a player is invited while not being in the same lobby, they will receive a notification either in-game or in their Roblox notifications, giving them an option to dismiss the invite or to join the lobby.  "]},"\n\n",{"type":"ul","props":{},"children":["\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwPA"},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwPQ"},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/File:Matchmaking6.png","title":"Invite in the lobby."},"children":["Invite in the lobby."]}]}]},{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwQQ"},"children":["Invite in the lobby."]}]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwQw"},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwRA"},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/File:MatchInvite.png","title":"Invite during a match."},"children":["Invite during a match."]}]}]},{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwSA"},"children":["Invite during a match."]}]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwSg"},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwSw"},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/File:MatchInviteSite.png","title":"Invite on the Roblox site."},"children":["Invite on the Roblox site."]}]}]},{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwTw"},"children":["Invite on the Roblox site."]}]},"\n"]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["Invites during a match or on the Roblox sites can have the text:"]},"\n",{"type":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["The towers needs you! ",{"type":"i","props":{},"children":["[Friend name]"]}," is waiting for you in Tower Defense Simulator!"]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["Defend the towers with ",{"type":"i","props":{},"children":["[Friend name]"]},"! Jump into Tower Defense Simulator!"]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["Heads up! ",{"type":"i","props":{},"children":["[Friend name]"]}," wants you to help defend in Tower Defense Simulator!"]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["Wave incoming! ",{"type":"i","props":{},"children":["[Friend name]"]}," is inviting you to battle it out in Tower Defense Simulator!"]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"i","props":{},"children":["[Friend name]"]}," is gathering a squad in Tower Defense Simulator! Join the team now!"]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["Ready to strategize? ",{"type":"i","props":{},"children":["[Friend name]"]}," is calling you to Tower Defense Simulator!"]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["Team up with ",{"type":"i","props":{},"children":["[Friend name]"]}," and crush the waves in Tower Defense Simulator!"]}]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["\n",{"type":"br","props":{},"children":[]}]},"\n\n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwYg"},"children":[]},{"type":"div","props":{},"children":["\n",{"type":"div","props":{},"children":[{"type":"figure","props":{},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Category:B